STEP 24 — INVENTORY RESERVATION
==================================================

Adding to cart must NOT permanently reduce inventory.

When an order is successfully created:

Reserve the requested quantity.

Example:

Stock = 50

Customer orders 10.

Result:

Stock = 50
Reserved = 10
Available = 40

If order is cancelled:

Reserved = 0
Available = 50

If order is confirmed:

Available stock is reduced appropriately.

The final stock validation must happen on the backend/database.

Prevent overselling when multiple customers order simultaneously.

